{
  "format": "pyric-replay/1",
  "project": "demo-live-traffic",
  "source": "hand-written from the firebase 12.12.0 SDK wire format: one Firestore Listen for a query of the bookings collection, answered with three documents, as a page sends it over WebChannel and the Node build over gRPC, for any account. Played beside live-mode-traffic.json by the live-mode-rates scenario. Not captured from production yet.",
